{
  "model": "opus",
  "modelSettings": {
    "claude-opus-5-5": { "effortLevel": "high" },
    "claude-fable-5-1": { "effortLevel": "high" },
    "claude-sonnet-5-5": { "effortLevel": "medium" },
    "claude-haiku-5-5": { "effortLevel": "low" }
  },
  "env": {
    "BASH_DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS": "600000",
    "BASH_MAX_TIMEOUT_MS": "600000",
    "PYTHONUNBUFFERED": "1"
  },
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
      "Bash(git *)",
      "Bash(python3 *)",
      "Bash(bash cloud/*)",
      "Bash(pip install *)",
      "Bash(gh pr merge *)",
      "Bash(gh pr view *)",
      "Bash(gh pr checks *)",
      "Bash(gh api repos/sparkiscool/nox/pulls/*)",
      "Bash(gh api -X PUT repos/sparkiscool/nox/pulls/*)",
      "Bash",
      "Edit",
      "Read",
      "WebFetch",
      "WebSearch",
      "mcp__amazon-parts",
      "Bash(gh *)",
      "Bash(uv *)"
    ],
    "defaultMode": "bypassPermissions",
    "deny": [
      "Bash(git push --force*)",
      "Bash(git push -f *)",
      "Bash(git push * --force*)",
      "Bash(git push * -f *)"
    ]
  },
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bash cloud/session_start.sh",
            "timeout": 600
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "enableAllProjectMcpServers": true,
  "autoMode": {
    "allow": [
      "$defaults",
      "Merging a pull request of sparkiscool/nox into main with gh pr merge or the GitHub REST merge call: a part PR after the review agent reported PASS; a tooling, docs, config or research PR after the session's own check. No PR waits on Spark (CLAUDE.md step 4).",
      "Pushing to any branch, creating branches and PRs, merging main into a branch and resolving conflicts, deleting a branch after its PR merged, pip or uv installs, bash cloud/*.sh, web fetches and searches for research, and the amazon-parts MCP tools (catalog, cart links, log_order). Direct Amazon purchases (place_business_order) stay off."
    ]
  },
  "askUserQuestionTimeout": "60s"
}
